WEBVTT

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.480
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.050
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World,

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.020
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.760
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:16.980
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.860
with the attacking Bagra army.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:26.270
I was about to be executed by the 
Bagra Army in the Magma Zone.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:29.650
It was Dorulumon who saved me.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.980
Some called him a traitor,

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.110
but I always believed in him.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:43.040
Along with our new friends,

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.420
we took off for the next Zone.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:51.500
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:51.500
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:51.500
<b>Team ?                       Team Taiki                    Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:51.500
Mysterious
Girl

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:51.500
<b>Enemy?                                    Enemy?

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:51.500
Rival

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:51.500
Protagonist

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.510
<b>Taiki Becomes a Knight!</b>

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:56.030
Taiki Becomes a Knight!

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:01.580
We're here!

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.110
A new Zone!

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.320
Pretty place.

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:13.690
Hey!

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:16.720
Give me the lowdown on this Zone!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:20.020
Is the Bagra Army causing trouble here, too?

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:23.800
What's the problem? 
We're not a bunch of weirdos or—

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.630
Yikes, that's cold!

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:30.960
No way...

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:33.420
They're all frozen!

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.490
You think this is...

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:37.270
Looks like you didn't even have to ask.

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:39.810
The Bagra Army did this to them.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:43.110
This sound...

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:45.750
Hey!

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:49.840
What is it, Taiki?

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:51.860
It's just like when I saved you!

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:53.290
The melody is different,

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:56.230
but I can hear the sound of 
someone who's close to dying!

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:01.230
Hey!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.800
Did something happen here?

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.930
Our leader, Sir Knightmon,

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:07.640
was attacked by the Bagra 
Army and fell into the lake!

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.520
If we can't get him out, he'll die!

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.140
Knightmon...

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.150
Knightmon!

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.920
Knightmon, can you hear me?

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:20.990
Knightmon! Answer me!

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:21.920
Knightmon!

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:26.410
Who calls my name?

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:29.360
I'm Taiki Kudou.

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.040
I'm a human!

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.100
A human?

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:36.410
Could you be the General 
we have been searching for?

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:38.540
How regrettable...

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:43.760
If I had met you sooner, perhaps I 
could have protected the princess...

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.240
Don't give up!

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.910
All your subordinates are crying for you!

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:48.690
You've gotta live!

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:50.620
This is the end for me.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:54.900
Please, just help all the PawnChessmons...

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.510
Don't start making last requests!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.100
Hey, don't tell me you're...

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:07.910
I can't turn my back on this Digimon!

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:10.570
There's that bad habit again!

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.140
Taiki, stop!

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.010
Cold!

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.880
He just dove into that frozen lake!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.350
You really saved me, ChibiKamemon.

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:43.200
I'm glad I could help.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:44.450
Ow!

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:45.720
You idiot!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.050
You're lucky Zenjirou had 
the idea to send him!

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.870
Otherwise, you'd have frozen to death!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.550
I'm sorry, Akari. Don't get mad.

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:53.960
I will get mad!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.260
Cut him some slack, Akari.

00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:00.500
I'm alive today because 
Taiki is the way he is.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:05.060
I know that!

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:09.400
<i>I know that's Taiki's best quality.</i>

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:13.670
<i>But it's also why we can't 
get back to our own world.</i>

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:18.700
<i>Mom and Dad must be worried about me...</i>

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.400
Is my phone broken?

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.440
Don't worry. Just watch.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.580
Reload, Knightmon!

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.820
Sir Knightmon has come back to life!

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.420
He's so cool!

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:37.470
Thank you, Master Taiki.

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:39.960
I owe you my life.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:44.100
Please come visit our Bastia Castle.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:48.560
Our princess has been searching 
for the legendary General.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:56.440
So we've lost another Zone?

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:00.030
Things aren't going your way, Tacty.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.880
Not true.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:08.800
Soon enough, I will conquer all.

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:09.950
Perfectly.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:12.610
If I may have a moment, you two?

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:13.540
Who goes there?!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.830
Baalmon...

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:18.960
We have no business with a Reaper.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.730
I don't see Lady Lilithmon.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:24.040
And you have no right to know why.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:26.300
She's gone to the Lake Zone.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:30.750
IceDevimon has invaded there.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:32.280
Thank you.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.060
Blastmon.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.480
Yes, Tacty?

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:39.120
Think before you divulge 
military intelligence.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.800
Rock Damashi!

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:04.510
Wh-Who are you?!

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.500
You wanna know?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.610
Of course you do!

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:09.390
I'm—

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:10.790
This is the legendary General,

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:13.730
Master Taiki, and his companions!

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:17.530
Why'd you have to take 
over on the best part?!

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:18.560
Shut up and fight!

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:19.500
Exactly!

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:19.960
Yeah!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.480
Oh, Knightmon is back!

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.130
And he brought the General!

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.640
Everyone join forces with 
the Digimon in the castle

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:33.040
and run off the enemy!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.290
Retreat!

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.260
Yeah!

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:55.050
That is our leader,

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:57.480
the princess of Bastia Castle, 
Princess Bastemon.

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:01.100
Does she have low blood pressure?

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:04.610
As you can see, the princess 
lives at her own pace.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.250
She spends two thirds of each day sleeping.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.610
Is she a real cat?!

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:14.810
Forgive me, Sir Taiki.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.120
I am the princess Bastemon.

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:23.630
I truly thank you for saving 
Sir Knightmon, and this castle.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.700
Oh, I didn't do anything special—

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:26.850
You are too modest!

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:30.160
Princess, Master Taiki is the true General.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.730
I would like to make him the 
captain of this castle's knights.

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:35.620
Oh, my, what to do?

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:39.820
I already had someone in 
mind to lead the knights.

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.660
He appears to be a General, too.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:47.260
How shall I decide?

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:50.340
Hey...

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.180
What's with this girl?!

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:54.590
She just tossed her problems at 
us and then went back to sleep!

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:58.020
What will you do, Taiki?

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.770
Settle it with a fight?

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:01.730
You!

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:05.450
So you were the other one 
she had in mind, Kiriha?

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.690
Hey! I'm thirsty!

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:16.670
Where's my special Absolute Zero Drink?!

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:19.040
I'm drinking it.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:21.470
Lady Lilithmon!

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:26.530
It's the only good, refreshing 
drink around here.

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:29.870
Everything else is tepid. Too tepid.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:34.860
And what's especially tepid is 
your battle strategy, IceDevimon.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:38.060
Please forgive me, Lady Lilithmon!

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:41.650
When are you going to steal the Code Crown

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:44.170
that's supposedly hidden in the castle?

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.430
When you're this sluggish...

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:48.610
it makes me want to explode.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:50.920
I have a new plan up my sleeve!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.110
It will work! It will!

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:54.050
And what brings you here,

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:56.590
filthy Reaper?

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:58.550
I've come to make a sales pitch.

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:02.320
Your henchman appears to be a bit dull.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:03.960
I thought perhaps I could help.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:04.860
What was that?!

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:07.360
I smell a hidden agenda.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.230
Don't say that.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:12.050
I would do anything to win your favor.

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:15.050
So, you've got a thing for me, have you?

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:18.150
Please keep this a secret 
from the other two of the

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:19.440
Three Head Officers.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:23.710
Then would you eliminate the boy 
with the Xros Loader for me?

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:27.720
It seems he has already given 
this dimwit enough grief.

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:28.850
<i>She already knows?!</i>

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.520
A simple task.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:38.170
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.640
They may be made up of data,

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:45.560
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.630
Join us in our world of adventure

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.200
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.270
DigiXros!

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:30.840
DigiNoir is so delicious!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:34.010
I can really eat as much as I want?!

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:36.370
Of course. This banquet is to 
show our gratitude, after all.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.240
Yahoo!

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.590
He's head over heels for DigiNoir.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.870
And he's the one who was just shouting at us

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.650
not to let our guard down so 
Kiriha won't do anything bad.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:51.690
This is the one food in this world 
that's actually pretty good.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.880
Indeed.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.200
You didn't come to protect 
the castle, did you?

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.490
Of course not.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.430
I came for the Code Crown.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.080
But then...

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:06.840
That weird princess threw me off course.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:10.540
The Bagra Army is easier 
to deal with than she is.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:14.010
<i>I've never seen that look on his face...</i>

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:19.180
<i>What was that darkness I 
sensed in him back then?</i>

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:23.190
I see your ranks have grown.

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:23.960
Huh?

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:28.470
Last time, you won before I 
even had a chance to show up,

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.120
but next time, I will defeat IceDevimon,

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:33.800
and the Code Crown will be mine.

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:37.190
What's with you guys?

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:40.230
We're on watch to make sure he 
doesn't pull anything on you!

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:44.300
I do not sense the warmth in 
him that I do in Master Taiki.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.510
But I don't think that's all there is to it.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:51.020
When I look at him, I sort of...

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:52.030
Hold it!

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:56.020
You're not going to say you can't 
turn your back on him, too, are you?

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:58.430
Why are you always like that?!

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:02.300
That day...

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:04.870
That's right... It was raining.

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:10.470
I didn't know that boy well.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:13.400
I had just met him after switching classes.

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:17.610
I couldn't turn my back on him... But...

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.940
<i>Just shut up. I'm fine.</i>

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:54.780
I heard that he'd taken a bad 
hit to the head in a game.

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:10.620
He was out of school for half a year.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.380
Every time I looked at 
his desk, my heart ached.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.870
So I thought,

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.310
if I feel like I can't turn my 
back on someone, even for a moment,

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:20.540
then I can't turn my back 
on them, no matter what.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:22.810
Taiki Kudou...

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:27.060
That's why I always end up on the 
move before I even realize it.

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:29.220
In that moment...

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:32.280
My heart goes back to that rainy day.

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.910
Taiki is a good man.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:35.680
I like him even more now.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:38.720
That is truly the heart of a knight.

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:41.660
Oh, stop. It's nothing that special.

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:44.060
It's just, what do they 
call it... past torafugu?

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:46.060
I love fugu sashimi.

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:47.840
You mean trauma.

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:51.450
The enemy!

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:00.950
So many of them!

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:03.750
Heavy Speaker!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.800
Dorulu Tornado!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.460
You okay?

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:09.400
Thank you.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.570
Where's everyone else?

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:13.260
They've passed out from eating too much!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.050
You're kidding me!

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:16.530
Was that...

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:18.670
Kiriha?

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.420
Want to try that again? It's been a while.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.300
Yeah.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:33.780
Let's show Taiki a Blue Flare DigiXros.

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:37.420
Greymon!

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.050
MailBirdramon!

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.750
DigiXros!

00:15:57.090 --> 00:16:00.740
MetalGreymon!

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.780
Go, MetalGreymon.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:17.260
Trident Arm!

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:25.160
Giga Destroyer!

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:31.340
He's merciless...

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:33.070
He's so strong!

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:34.740
Yeah. But it's strange...

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.660
I can't see their leader anywhere.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:38.960
You're right.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.730
Where is IceDevimon?

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:44.080
Shoutmon!

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.380
Oh no, how awful.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.880
A battle broke out while I was sleeping?

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:04.250
IceDevimon!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:07.110
Looks like my diversion plan worked.

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:08.610
Seize her!

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:11.780
You will tell me where the Code Crown is.

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:13.710
Soul Crusher!

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:16.460
It can't be!

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:19.320
Why weren't you fighting in the battle?!

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:23.270
We saw through your plan!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.620
Shoutmon!

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:25.990
Princess!

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:41.480
What?

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.170
Soul Crusher!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:47.450
Drill Buster!

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.130
Knight!

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:56.870
Horn Breaker!

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:02.540
Taiki! We need X4!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.400
We can't! Ballistamon's frozen!

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.210
Knight!

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:11.400
Taiki! Shoutmon and I will 
give you some cover fire!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.150
Okay!

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:13.540
Taiki!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.100
Sorry, but I need you to die,

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:18.880
boy with the Xros Loader!

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:26.870
Ballistamon!

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:42.220
Taiki!

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:46.570
Shoutmon!

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:47.710
Dorulumon!

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:52.580
DigiXros!

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.570
Shoutmon!

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.650
Dorulumon!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.210
DigiXros!

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:13.310
Dorulu Cannon!

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:20.070
Lock on!

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:30.880
Now, Knightmon!

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:35.120
Checkmate Break!

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:44.180
I'll remember this!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.410
The remaining enemies are retreating!

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.330
Victory is ours!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:53.770
Kiriha...

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:55.750
We lost this one.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:59.080
Taiki saw through his diversion plan.

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:00.610
Can you leave it at that, Kiriha?

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:02.600
I'll give this one to Taiki.

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.850
I can't stand that princess anyway.

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:09.510
You are the true General, Sir Taiki.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:11.890
I don't need that other guy.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:15.560
I am impressed. 
This is a great honor for you!

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.380
O-Oh, it is?

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:19.360
Forget honor! Break it up!

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:24.220
Well, anyway, I'm glad we... pulled it off...

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:28.510
Taiki!

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:29.710
Master Taiki!

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.870
H-He's done it again!

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.960
He tried too hard and wore himself down!

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:35.840
What do we do?

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:38.950
With Taiki out, we can't 
stop the enemy's plans!

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:41.610
We can't even DigiXros!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:45.680
They are in a bind.

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:46.690
A bind, indeed.

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:51.920
Every last one of them, useless.

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:55.640
I guess I have no choice but to use him.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.600
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.840
<b>Monitamon's Lovely♥ Enemy Search</b>

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.840
Searching for enemy data.

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.410
ChibiKamemon.

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.890
When fused through DigiXros,

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:08.740
he makes X2 move faster underwater 
and increases defense.

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:11.580
<b>[Type]

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:11.580
<b>Cyborg Type</b>

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:11.580
<b>Cora Guard {B: translates to "shell" so maybe Shell Guard?}

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:11.500
But why does he wear a helmet?

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:14.490
Just look at him and think about it!

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.690
Taiki's passed out!

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:20.630
And now their secret weapon, 
Daipenmon, is coming after us!

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.990
Akari went to look for her 
mother and disappeared?

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:26.190
Something's going on! 
Shoutmon, let's look for Akari!

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:27.400
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:29.330
<b>Burn, Xros Heart!</b>

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.400
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
